----------------------------------------------------------------
SimKGC (intfloat/SimKGC)
----------------------------------------------------------------
The bi-encoder stage of the pipeline is provided by SimKGC. The new
repository does NOT ship a copy of SimKGC; instead, scripts/00_setup.py
clones it on demand from upstream:

    git clone https://github.com/intfloat/SimKGC vendored/SimKGC

The upstream SimKGC repository does not include a LICENSE file or any
written usage statement. Users of this project must obtain SimKGC
directly from the upstream maintainers and must respect the original
authors' rights. The cite below is the published artifact.

Patches applied to the cloned SimKGC tree (see scripts/00_setup.py):
  - vendored/SimKGC/trainer.py: changes the AdamW import from
    `from transformers import AdamW` to `from torch.optim import AdamW`
    (transformers >= 4.0 removed the re-export).

Citation:

    @inproceedings{wang-etal-2022-simkgc,
        title     = "{S}im{KGC}: Simple Contrastive Knowledge Graph
                     Completion with Pre-trained Language Models",
