----------------------------------------------------------------
Datasets
----------------------------------------------------------------
CoDEx-M (Safavi & Koutra, 2020):
    https://github.com/tsafavi/codex
    Released under the CC-BY 4.0 license.

FB15k-237 (Toutanova et al., 2015):
    Originally derived from Freebase; commonly distributed via
    https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/download/details.aspx?id=52312

WN18RR (Dettmers et al., 2018):
    Derived from WordNet; commonly distributed alongside the
    ConvE codebase (github.com/TimDettmers/ConvE).

scripts/01_prepare_data.py downloads each dataset from its upstream
location at run time; this project does not redistribute any of them.

